{"id":"2378494899","kind":"answer","title":"艾宾浩斯曲线真的有效吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-03-07","updated":"2023-10-23","votes":21,"comment_count":7,"minutes":1,"chars":470,"keywords":["间隔重复","分散练习","测试效应","刻意练习","运动技能"],"summary":"首先，题主贴的这个图： 根本不是艾宾浩斯提出来的。目前可以追溯到的，最早的，体现多次复习对遗忘曲线影响的图表，是 Paul Pimsleur 在 1967 年的论文 A Memory Schedule 中提出的： https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/j.1540-4781.1…","question_detail_html":"<p>如题，比如之前上学时学过的数学公式，记忆已经重复了非常非常多次，但几年后却只有一个模糊的印象，这跟艾宾浩斯曲线的提到的隔一段时间复习一下，能够牢记似乎相悖（因为之前已经记忆了很多次了），所以想问下艾宾浩斯曲线是否真的有效？</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-56360d0ce0ef88dc5e2ff243d29f5f15_r.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d72190f1c97b6f24b080bf9566b6e0c8_r.jpg\" width=\"662\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/520519063/answer/2378494899","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"D463Yy_m\">首先，题主贴的这个图：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-96e193d29c39a0479adee80f5fb724bb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-76cc2766f4418e88125a1735cbe31ff4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-76cc2766f4418e88125a1735cbe31ff4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"662\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-96e193d29c39a0479adee80f5fb724bb_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-76cc2766f4418e88125a1735cbe31ff4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-76cc2766f4418e88125a1735cbe31ff4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"662\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"gPVlm1L2\">根本不是艾宾浩斯提出来的。目前可以追溯到的，最早的，体现多次复习对遗忘曲线影响的图表，是 Paul Pimsleur 在 1967 年的论文 A Memory Schedule 中提出的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e377758cb546c8bfa64afb7a6dbb6459_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-492cb3201460f2a7a9a1569f0a363661\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-492cb3201460f2a7a9a1569f0a363661_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e377758cb546c8bfa64afb7a6dbb6459_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-492cb3201460f2a7a9a1569f0a363661\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-492cb3201460f2a7a9a1569f0a363661_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/><figcaption>https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/j.1540-4781.1967.tb06700.x</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"KU5_DeWE\">另外，这幅图中也不存在所谓的牢记现象：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d2f2054cb9e550235082d91f918e9d1c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ee48730bace03bd104861b0d1ae5c2df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ee48730bace03bd104861b0d1ae5c2df_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"722\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d2f2054cb9e550235082d91f918e9d1c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-ee48730bace03bd104861b0d1ae5c2df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ee48730bace03bd104861b0d1ae5c2df_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"722\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ElkGLhE5\">在这张图中，遗忘曲线变平，似乎暗示了记忆程度将不会随时间下降。但在现实生活中，几乎不存在这种记忆。举个例子，你还记得你小学同学的名字么？能记得几个？很久没联系的那些同学你能想起来吗？</p><p data-pid=\"SYz_vPz2\">然后，题主提到的这种记忆方法，实际上叫做间隔重复（spaced repetition），通过合理安排复习间隔多次主动回忆所学内容，可以巩固记忆，减缓遗忘，但并不意味着能够让你永远记住。</p><p data-pid=\"3xcyOYTy\">关于间隔重复是否有效，有很多文献通过对照实验证明：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-c411e5e812bd614048b34e5a1f48eb9f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1264\" data-image-width=\"2240\" data-tm-id=\"420924493\" href=\"#/post/420924493\">叶峻峣：(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应</a><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f5680cadce4d3500c419a1da9f98e581_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c932be024fef955f93dd30e9fa701352\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c932be024fef955f93dd30e9fa701352_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"757\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f5680cadce4d3500c419a1da9f98e581_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c932be024fef955f93dd30e9fa701352\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c932be024fef955f93dd30e9fa701352_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"757\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Nuw9n3YQ\">希望能解答题主的疑惑。</p><p data-pid=\"34x63i17\"><br/>本文已加入：</p><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/collection/925510885\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">艾宾浩斯记忆法打假合集</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"420924493","title":"(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":95,"minutes":32,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"420309917","title":"(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":170,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"453406457","title":"(5/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——脚注","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":38,"minutes":51,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"423065882","title":"(4/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——应用指南","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":117,"minutes":29,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"423449068","title":"测试效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2680582773","title":"怎样提高自己的记忆能力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":815,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 815 赞同"},{"id":"2311948292","title":"用了墨墨232天还是每天都有3分之1左右的单词忘记 啥情况啊?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 10 赞同"},{"id":"2260335569","title":"当天背的内容到底回顾几次不浪费时间？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":33,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 33 赞同"},{"id":"3320259157","title":"艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线怎么使用？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":103,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 103 赞同"},{"id":"1960104249884141059","title":"优秀学生们是如何利用高效记忆法来快速掌握知识的？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":220,"minutes":36,"reason":"相似问答 · 220 赞同"}]}